  "body": "If your family has outgrown suburbia but you are not prepared to compromise on quality, 8B Willow Lane deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nSet on approximately 2.1 hectares of predominantly flat to gently sloping land, this substantial single-level residence offers a rare combination of lifestyle space, quality construction and convenient access to Silverdale, Albany and the wider North Shore.\r\n\r\nDesigned and built by David Reid Homes, the approximately 327sqm home features timeless Hinuera stone and brick construction, generous 2.7m stud heights and a practical family-friendly layout. Five bedrooms, two bathrooms plus a guest toilet, and two separate living areas provide flexibility for growing families, entertaining, working from home or accommodating extended family. The spacious kitchen and dedicated butler's pantry make everyday living and larger gatherings effortless.\r\n\r\nOutside, the usable land offers exciting possibilities. Create gardens or paddocks, or explore the potential for a pool, tennis court, substantial shed or outdoor entertaining area. Triple internal-access garaging and additional parking provide room for family vehicles, a boat, trailer or motorhome. The Stillwater boat ramp is nearby, while Silverdale and Albany offer convenient shopping, schools and motorway connections.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n\r\n* Approx. 2.1ha of predominantly usable land\r\n* Approx. 327sqm single-level residence\r\n* Five bedrooms and two living areas\r\n* Two bathrooms plus guest toilet\r\n* David Reid Homes construction\r\n* Hinuera stone and brick exterior\r\n* Generous 2.7m stud height\r\n* Kitchen with dedicated butler's pantry\r\n* Triple internal-access garaging\r\n* Parking for a boat or motorhome\r\n* Scope for a pool, shed, gardens or paddocks\r\n* Close to Silverdale, Albany and the boat ramp\r\n\r\nThe owners are committed to downsizing and ready to meet the market. Serious offers are invited, with private inspections available throughout the week.\r\nAny proposed additions or land uses are subject to Council requirements and purchaser due diligence.\r\n\r\nTo view and download property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/XD2W",
